+# Glossary
+
+- **Order**: an instruction to buy or sell a quantity at a price.
+- **Fill**: an execution report for part or all of an order. Each fill has a unique id.
+- **Reservation**: the part of the balance held for open buy orders.
+- **Invariant**: a property that holds after every event, whatever the sequence of events.
+- **Gate**: the program that judges a change against rules taken from the base revision.
+- **Evidence**: what the gate writes for a reviewer: verdict, checks, counterexample, files to read first.
+- **Escalation**: a verdict that sends the change to a human instead of back to the agent.
